  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Gateron Low Profile (KS-27 & KS-33) style mechanical keyboard switch, Gateron Low Profile hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Gateron Low Profile and Cherry MX Low Profile are NOT compatible. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R2.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 2.25u (courtyard 42.81x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features.")
